OL,3,GNEWSADecision on future of beach bar
OL,4,Asite moves closer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA decision on the future use of a
OL,7,Fseafront venue is a step closer to
OL,8,Fbeing finalised following approval of a
OL,9,Fcouncil's cabinet.
OL,11,FThe lease on a section of land on
OL,12,FSouthbourne Promenade currently
OL,13,Foccupied by Sobo Beach cafe and bar
OL,14,Fexpires on October 31.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
