OL,3,GNEWSADecision on future of beach bar
OL,4,Asite moves closer
OL,5,
OL,6,FBournemouth, Christchurch and Poole
OL,7,F(BCP) Council has marketed the site and
OL,8,Fhas been working to secure an operator
OL,9,Ffor the premises from 1 December, and
OL,10,Fat a meeting held earlier this week
OL,11,Fcouncillor Richard Herrett said there
OL,12,Fwas an "exciting offer that will take
OL,13,Fthis area through the next 20 years".
OL,15,FThe council's cabinet unanimously
OL,16,Fapproved recommending the contract to
OL,17,Ffull council to approve granting a new
OL,18,F20-year lease for the site.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
